.TH VIDI 1 "" "vidi" "vidi manual"
.SH NAME
vidi \- browse a local git repository in the terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vidi [\-h] [\-\-version] [repo_dir]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the repository you are in when given no path. Settings such as the theme and the language scan are changed inside the app from the command palette (Ctrl+P).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
show this help message and exit
.TP
.B \-\-version
show program's version number and exit
.TP
.B repo_dir
Path inside a local git repository (defaults to the current folder)
.SH KEYS
Press ? in the app to show these keys.
.SS Main screen
.TP
.B j / k  or  up / down
Move within the focused panel
.TP
.B tab / shift+tab
Switch between panels
.TP
.B enter
Open the commit, or the highlighted language's files
.TP
.B f
Browse the highlighted commit's files
.TP
.B /
Filter the commit table (esc clears)
.TP
.B left / right
Previous / next language, or back / forward a week on the graph
.TP
.B h / l
Select the older / newer active day
.TP
.B [ / ]
Step through years
.TP
.B r
Cycle the date range
.TP
.B b
Pick a branch
.TP
.B ?
Show the key reference
.TP
.B q
Quit
.SS Commit detail
.TP
.B j / k  or  up / down
Move within the focused pane
.TP
.B tab / shift+tab
Switch between panes
.TP
.B [ / ]
Previous / next commit
.TP
.B p
Toggle file diff and full patch
.TP
.B f
Browse this commit's files
.TP
.B /
Filter the files list, or search the patch
.TP
.B enter / shift+enter
Next / previous patch match while searching
.TP
.B n / N
Next / previous patch match
.TP
.B page up / page down
Scroll by a page
.TP
.B home / end
Jump to the top or bottom
.TP
.B esc / q
Back (esc first closes the search)
.SS Branch picker
.TP
.B type
Filter the branch list
.TP
.B up / down
Move the highlight
.TP
.B enter
Switch to the highlighted branch
.TP
.B esc / q
Cancel
.SS Commit files
.TP
.B j / k  or  up / down
Move between files
.TP
.B /
Filter the list (esc clears)
.TP
.B [ / ]
Previous / next commit
.TP
.B enter
Open the highlighted file
.TP
.B esc / q
Back
.SS File view
.TP
.B j / k  or  up / down
Scroll (arrows scroll even while searching)
.TP
.B /
Search in the file
.TP
.B enter / shift+enter
Next / previous match while searching
.TP
.B n / N
Next / previous match
.TP
.B [ / ]
Previous / next file
.TP
.B page up / page down
Scroll by a page
.TP
.B home / end
Jump to the top or bottom
.TP
.B esc / q
Back (esc first closes the search)
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/vidi/config.json
Saved preferences (honors XDG_CONFIG_HOME).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR git (1)
